# Chat 03: a helpful party member. ProbeBish (Bishop), party of two, filmed from {me}.
warp 104040000 140
darksight {me}
party {me} 0
offline ProbeBish
park
record FriendServer/BotStory Server/docs/agents/evidence/video/2026-09-26/raw/chat-03-helpful-companion.mp4
wait 1
say !spawnbot ProbeBish
cut
caption 6 A Bishop joins as a party of two - its buffs land on the camera character
park
online ProbeBish
party {me} 2
wait 8
say lemme get a fame
expectlog ACT \[fame me\]
park
caption 4 "lemme get a fame" - it fames the player
wait 4
say got anything that would be an upgrade for me?
park
caption 5 It checks its bag for gear that would help the player
wait 5
say what gear do u want from me?
park
caption 5 ...and says what it would like in return
wait 5
say turn off your buffs for now
expectlog -> support off
park
caption 4 Buffs off on request
wait 4
say ok buff me again pls
expectlog -> support on
park
caption 5 ...and back on: it recasts its buffs right away
freshbuff {me} 2311003 15
wait 4
stop
# Teardown (not recorded): sign off, dissolve the two-person party.
signoff ProbeBish
say !leaveparty
party {me} 0
